const faq=`<section class="section faq" id="faq"><div><span class="eyebrow">A little peace of mind</span><h2>Common <em>questions.</em></h2><a class="text-link" href="${C.call}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a free discovery call ${arrow}</a><img class="faq-photo" src="assets/faq-floating-breakfast.webp" width="998" height="1500" alt="T World Tours traveler enjoying a floating breakfast in an infinity pool overlooking tropical greenery" loading="lazy"></div><div>
<details><summary>I’m traveling solo. Can I still join?</summary><p>Absolutely. 85% of our travelers join solo! Our trips bring like-minded travelers together so you never have to worry about if you’ll make friends along the way. For double occupancy, our roommate matching form considers your travel style and preferences. Single rooms are subject to availability.</p></details>
<details><summary>Are payment plans available?</summary><p>Yes! All payment plans are interest-free. <strong>Click “View Summary”</strong> in your cart to see the standard schedule, or create an account at checkout to see <strong>more flexible payment plan options.</strong></p><p>Plans vary by trip, and booking early means smaller installments.</p></details>
<details><summary>Is Klarna financing available?</summary><p>Yes! You have the option to <strong>Travel Now and Pay Later</strong> through Klarna on all trips.</p><p>Klarna is a third-party financing company that lets you split your trip payment into installments between 3 - 36 months.</p><p>To check your eligibility, select your date and package. Fill out the booking details. Select <strong>Pay in Full</strong> and <strong>select Pay with Klarna.</strong></p><p>Cancellations and refunds are processed according to the T World Tours cancellation policy.</p></details>
<details><summary>What’s included in our group trips?</summary><p>Inclusions vary based on the group trip and destination. On average, most of our group trips include:</p><ul><li>4.5 to 5-star accommodations</li><li>All excursions and activities</li><li>Private airport transfers</li><li>Transfers to and from experiences</li><li>Multiple lunches and dinners</li><li>Breakfast daily</li><li>Goody bag</li><li>A local guide</li><li>TWT host</li><li>Photographer and edited photography for select days</li></ul></details>
<details><summary>Are flights included?</summary><p>Flights are not included. If you have questions about your flight before booking one, e-mail <a href="mailto:info@tworldtours.com">info@tworldtours.com</a> and they will assist.</p><p>We highly recommend purchasing a refundable flight or a flight with insurance in the case that you need to cancel your trip.</p></details>
<details><summary>How much cash should I bring on my trip for additional expenses?</summary><p>We try to cover at least 95% of the expenses on the ground, leaving the last 5% open for the free time in your itinerary. Please accommodate additional cash for personal souvenir shopping, tips, and any meals that may not be included. On average our travelers say they spend no more than $100 - $150 on every trip because all major touch points are covered.</p></details>
<details><summary>What if I need to cancel?</summary><p><strong>Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Cancel by email</strong> at <a href="mailto:info@tworldtours.com">info@tworldtours.com</a>.</li><li><strong>Deposits are non-refundable and non-transferable.</strong></li><li><strong>Refunds are trip credit only, never cash.</strong> Use it toward any T World Tours or T World Tours x Girls Trip Society trip.</li><li><strong>Credit amount:</strong><ul><li>Cancelled 61+ days before departure: 100%</li><li>Cancelled 31-60 days before departure: 50%</li><li>Cancelled 30 days or fewer: none</li></ul></li><li><strong>Credits expire 12 months after cancellation.</strong> You just need to rebook within that time. The trip can happen later.</li></ul><p>We require that travel insurance is purchased for all tours, and highly suggest “CFAR” [Cancel For Any Reason] policies.</p></details>
<details><summary>How do I know this trip is right for me?</summary><p>Let’s talk. Book a free discovery call with our team to discuss the itinerary, travel style, and any questions before you book.</p></details></div></section>`;
