const home=`<section class="hero"><img id="hero-photo" src="assets/header-boat-poster.jpg" alt="T World Tours travelers dancing in yellow on a boat in Thailand" fetchpriority="high"><div class="hero-content"><span class="eyebrow">Bucketlist destinations. Your kind of vacation</span><h1>Explore the world.<br><em>Meet your people.</em></h1><p>Luxury group trips for busy professionals, culture-seekers, and vibe curators.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn light" href="#group-trips">Explore 2027 trips ${arrow}</a><button class="watch" data-video="${C.journeyVideo}" data-title="A glimpse into our world"><span class="play">▶</span> A GLIMPSE INTO OUR WORLD</button></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>Less planning. More living.</span><button class="hero-video-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Pause background film">Ⅱ PAUSE FILM</button><span class="hero-dots"><button class="active" data-slide="1" aria-label="Show island escape" aria-pressed="true"></button><button data-slide="14" aria-label="Show Morocco desert" aria-pressed="false"></button><button data-slide="13" aria-label="Show Morocco waterfalls" aria-pressed="false"></button></span></div></section><div class="values"><span>Thoughtfully curated</span><span>Culture-rich experiences</span><span>Like-minded travelers</span><span>Beautifully effortless</span></div><section class="section intro reveal" id="about"><div><span class="eyebrow">Welcome to T World Tours</span><h2>Come for the <em>destination,</em><br>stay for the community.</h2></div><div><p>You work hard. Your time away should feel extraordinary. We curate luxury group experiences for ambitious professionals who crave culture, adventure, and a real sense of connection.</p><p style="margin-top:18px">From the first hello to the last sunset, we handle the details so you can be fully there. Come solo. Leave with your people.</p><a class="text-link" href="#experience">Discover the TWT way ${arrow}</a></div></section><section class="section trips" id="group-trips"><div class="section-head reveal"><div><span class="eyebrow">Your next great travel story starts here</span><h2>Featured trip</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="tours.html">Explore the collection ${arrow}</a></div>${trip}</section>${reviews}<section class="section journey" id="experience"><div class="journey-photo reveal"><img src="assets/4.jpg" alt="T World Tours travelers enjoying a cultural experience with an elephant" loading="lazy"><span class="photo-note">More than a getaway.</span></div><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">T World Tours</span><h2>Luxury travel,<br><em>without lifting a finger.</em></h2><p>Beautiful stays are only the beginning. We bring you closer to a place, its culture, and the people you’re sharing it with.</p><div class="promises"><div><span>01</span><div><h3>Every detail, considered.</h3><p>Thoughtfully curated itineraries, memorable surprises, unique themes, and beautiful, comfortable accommodations in safe locations booked with our travelers’ needs in mind.</p></div></div><div><span>02</span><div><h3>Connection comes naturally.</h3><p>Since 2019, we’ve carefully curated a community of travelers from all over the US with shared mindsets and similar interests. Arrive exactly as you are and with confidence that you’ll be met with kindness and curiosity.</p></div></div><div><span>03</span><div><h3>Be here. Be in it.</h3><p>We take care of the logistics. You make space for presence. This is your chance to finally take a backseat, take a deep breath, and let somebody else take care of you. All the hard parts of international travel are handled by our team so your only job is to get here and finally turn your brain off.</p></div></div></div></div></section>${faq}${cta}`;
